sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer
  participant S as Shop
  participant P as Payment
  C->>S: put items in the cart
  C->>S: check out
  Note over C,S: the cart is kept until it is paid
  S->>P: charge the card
  alt paid
    P-->>S: receipt
    S-->>C: order confirmed
  else declined
    P-->>S: declined
    S-->>C: choose another payment
  end
